  "text": "## CURRENT RATES (Effective January 15, 2026)  \n### SmartSaver Account (SAV-001)  \n**Variable Interest Rates by Balance Tier:**  \n| Tier | Balance Range | Annual Interest Rate (AER) |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tier 1** | £0–£10,000 | **4.50%** |\n| **Tier 2** | £10,001–£50,000 | **4.70%** |\n| **Tier 3** | £50,001+ | **4.80%** |  \n**Interest Accrual:** Daily (calculated on account balance)\n**Interest Payment:** Monthly (last business day of month)\n**Rate Type:** Variable (reviewed monthly)  \n**Variation Basis:**\n- Base: Bank of England Base Rate\n- Margin: +2.50% (fixed)\n- Current BoE Base Rate: 4.00% (as of 2026-01-15)  \n**Calculation Example (30-day month):**\n```\nBalance: £10,000 (Tier 1)\nDaily Rate: 4.50% ÷ 365 days = 0.01233%\nMonthly Interest: £10,000 × 0.01233% × 30 days = £36.99\nPaid on: Last business day of month\n```  \n---",
